nul
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
tmpclaude-*

# Output of the src/scripts/* parity tooling. These are dumps of a point-in-time database and a
# crawl of a running v1, regenerable by re-running the scripts — the scripts are the source, these
# are not. Keeping them tracked added ~43k lines of churn to an unrelated commit.
/v1-crawl.json
/v1-home.json
/v1-payload-map.json
/v1-title-map.json
/dupe-titles.json
/parity-*.json